<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | Alan Yeong" description="Information about cookies and similar technologies on alankyeong.com."><header class="page-hero"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Effective 24 August 2026</p><h1>Cookie policy</h1><p class="lead">How alankyeong.com currently uses cookies and similar technologies.</p></div></header><div class="page-body wrap narrow prose">
